{"user":{"streamUserId":"43353613-3164597673445855334","createdAt":1701183680781,"updatedAt":1701183680781,"lastActive":1775265025823,"settings":{"isInvisible":false},"name":"Jackson D","image":"https://www.strava.com/api/v3/athlete/19b0db5f6a0687e5a5d0a4ed458ceae9a4ae0b8bbd54b0fbf6cceb3eb0a3308b/1/avatar"},"messages":[{"id":"08f3c6b8-e336-4f5e-a4b6-a13edf518de2","cid":"direct_message:!members-Bn0JnJTIcIgKP8KgGlA7zDdWQOxS7Tp1EHOPvJYxUWA","text":"","type":"regular","attachments":[{"type":"activity","additionalFields":{"created_at_local":"2026-01-26T11:07:01","activity_type":"Workout","activity_id_string":"17185153204","activity_id":17185153204,"athlete_first_name":"JaQuavious","athlete_last_name":"Harris","avatar_url":"https://dgalywyr863hv.cloudfront.net/pictures/athletes/48348730/13717072/61/large.jpg"}}],"createdAt":1769455207411,"updatedAt":1769460354024,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"87dd89f2-69d4-456e-96a4-4ed02cf992eb","cid":"direct_message:!members-8EDHQvbNTH0DFM9VJmWRjNnOppOxI2wKuuc5DQVkpow","text":"Gotcha yeah this snow changes things for me too. I’ll try to join but might have to do my workout on a treadmill if it’s slippery enough- will for sure be joining for one of these workouts though I appreciate you letting me know","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1768864876122,"updatedAt":1768864876122,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"40a130a2-679e-4305-9c3e-64f13ac7dea5","cid":"direct_message:!members-8EDHQvbNTH0DFM9VJmWRjNnOppOxI2wKuuc5DQVkpow","text":"Thanks for the heads up! I may join, but was planning on joining Tuesday at mit track- that’s at 6:30 right?","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1768789091048,"updatedAt":1768789091048,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"c4c7c14f-293c-4290-85e1-f941c548400c","cid":"direct_message:!members-8EDHQvbNTH0DFM9VJmWRjNnOppOxI2wKuuc5DQVkpow","text":"Hey man, do you and the rats still meet Monday mornings? I might have just missed y’all today…","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1768232473428,"updatedAt":1768232473428,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"605be348-f1a9-447b-b16b-49f98fec52c2","cid":"direct_message:!members-T68W0O4KtL6uMlrA9Y36uEfZcpDzXi4DI2YLZOVHxvA","text":"Great, thank you! Did I tell Jialin that I am running Boston? I got in with the B.A.A. run club and my time","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1764962457440,"updatedAt":1764962457440,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"7153dcdb-8d17-477d-b159-cffd9f45aef3","cid":"direct_message:!members-T68W0O4KtL6uMlrA9Y36uEfZcpDzXi4DI2YLZOVHxvA","text":"Oh wow that’s great I had no idea. I just downloaded to start logging miles now. Do you recommend the evo SL or the Boston more?","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1764962239062,"updatedAt":1764962239062,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"9f0d9fa4-86c2-4b45-8c1c-c72ea892b840","cid":"direct_message:!members-T68W0O4KtL6uMlrA9Y36uEfZcpDzXi4DI2YLZOVHxvA","text":"Ok I see you had some points. I saw it was 40% off but you got it down even more.","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1764959975609,"updatedAt":1764959975609,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"5d80095c-a851-44c0-8c7f-bb663f459ce4","cid":"direct_message:!members-T68W0O4KtL6uMlrA9Y36uEfZcpDzXi4DI2YLZOVHxvA","text":"And how did you already buy the 2026 jacket?","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1764944495156,"updatedAt":1764944495156,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"fdddae0b-b06e-4a9f-9a2f-4f88b887c0ab","cid":"direct_message:!members-T68W0O4KtL6uMlrA9Y36uEfZcpDzXi4DI2YLZOVHxvA","text":"How did you get the evo sl’s for $63??","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1764944213985,"updatedAt":1764944213985,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"48884e07-c2ba-4ae0-9474-462832fa5752","cid":"direct_message:!members-Jj-BgfCglu3uMyzDI7y1dVES8KbPFQxi0udlCBJJUYA","text":"Yeah that’s great for me, will see you then. Also my number is (385) 251-6283 if that’s easier to communicate","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1763498931917,"updatedAt":1763500702947,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"a7077505-ad76-4bc8-91bb-b32760639af2","cid":"direct_message:!members-Jj-BgfCglu3uMyzDI7y1dVES8KbPFQxi0udlCBJJUYA","text":"Oh yeah for sure! Thursday works better for me. Maybe we meet somewhere on the community path between lechmere and Gilman? I’m flexible on time","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1763411857926,"updatedAt":1763411857926,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"908cf62c-68e4-466f-abbe-b289ce1e0c43","cid":"direct_message:!members-DXWkzXJQUMeJBBZKUyKXtKu4i5lCiXKnWt1kKaK_0fc","text":"Thanks! I can’t really this Sunday… but I could come down to you in slc either Monday or Wednesday for some easy miles. I could probably get down there early ish to avoid the heat too. \n\nAlso my number is 385 251 6283 if that’s easier","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1746745901203,"updatedAt":1746745901203,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"2f2a866e-7965-4943-a23c-3da6d94d003d","cid":"direct_message:!members-DXWkzXJQUMeJBBZKUyKXtKu4i5lCiXKnWt1kKaK_0fc","text":"Thanks! Yeah that would be awesome! Not sure I’d want to do anything too technical or uphill like you do but once ive got my plan made for that week before let’s see if we can get together for an easier run","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1744631813006,"updatedAt":1744631813006,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"3be6d627-2487-4552-996f-330b9ad304ad","cid":"direct_message:!members-DXWkzXJQUMeJBBZKUyKXtKu4i5lCiXKnWt1kKaK_0fc","text":"Oh I hadn’t heard of that one but it looks pretty cool. Yeah I’m doing it again! Hoping for a better outcome than last year haha","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1744552399535,"updatedAt":1744552399535,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"cf7496cb-d9f0-407c-8f83-acb4d1169e33","cid":"direct_message:!members-DXWkzXJQUMeJBBZKUyKXtKu4i5lCiXKnWt1kKaK_0fc","text":"Hey man you running Ogden again this year?","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1744474272872,"updatedAt":1744474272872,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"5f742c1f-d3eb-4cb1-9d32-2fe8da37e005","cid":"direct_message:!members-3MkywCdcGnbmkZ-EhpOHyVzNnOx3bsyMWgJWuTP3ZPw","text":"Yeah that makes sense. It was really nice and a beautiful run through the canyon. I’ll be there for about a week and a half before for a wedding too","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1743939000483,"updatedAt":1743943933178,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"e547d31c-53d0-493d-8e95-e90790637a7d","cid":"direct_message:!members-3MkywCdcGnbmkZ-EhpOHyVzNnOx3bsyMWgJWuTP3ZPw","text":"Are you thinking of running it?","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1743884630831,"updatedAt":1743884630831,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"12e6f52a-5a3e-4611-a742-2759082a1ac2","cid":"direct_message:!members-3MkywCdcGnbmkZ-EhpOHyVzNnOx3bsyMWgJWuTP3ZPw","text":"I’m running Ogden marathon yeah! May 17. And my sister, sister in law, best friend and his wife are all running the half","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1743882404807,"updatedAt":1743882404807,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null},{"id":"0d462cd1-7653-4da1-9a61-8d30ec403cd1","cid":"direct_message:!members-1K8oopDm_lwF8uOrJVN3G5-xAaIedwR43Rw8iPfoxJo","text":"That’s sounds like fun! Would love to come if I can make it. Hahah I had forgotten about this new feature even, my number is 385 251 6283!","type":"regular","attachments":[],"createdAt":1725284472676,"updatedAt":1725312170071,"deletedAt":null,"isPinned":false,"pinnedAt":null}],"reactions":[{"userId":"43353613-3164597673445855334","messageId":"3a65deaf-f82e-4794-a951-e0979e6dbb79","createdAt":17649599